OL,3,ARNLI volunteer targeted online and
OL,4,Abranded 'traitor' after Portsmouth
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn RNLI volunteer who was targeted with
OL,8,Fabuse online after being wrongly
OL,9,Fidentified as having helped small boat
OL,10,Fmigrants reach land in Portsmouth has
OL,11,Ftold BBC Verify he is not a "traitor".
OL,13,FNeil and his colleagues were filmed
OL,14,Fwearing their lifesaving gear on a
OL,15,Flifeboat by anti-migrant activists near
OL,16,Fthe harbour on Sunday night, after
OL,17,Fhundreds of protesters descended on the
OL,18,Farea and shut down roads in response to
OL,19,Fdozens of asylum seekers being brought
OL,20,Fto shore.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
