OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARNLI volunteer targeted online and
OL,4,Abranded 'traitor' after Portsmouth
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe lifeboat crew's images were later
OL,8,Fused in posts accusing them of
OL,9,Fassisting what some users on X
OL,10,Fdescribed as "an invasion", several of
OL,11,Fwhich also called for them to be "named
OL,12,Fand shamed".
OL,14,FThese posts, which were collectively
OL,15,Fviewed at least two million times, also
OL,16,Fincorrectly claimed Neil and another
OL,17,Fcolleague were two entirely different
OL,18,FRNLI crew members whose names were
OL,19,Favailable online.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
